                       "description":  "The Generator Evaluation page is a multi-tabbed development tool that provides four perspectives on workflow generation quality. Users navigate between the Dashboard (aggregate metrics), Pipeline Inspector (step-by-step generation analysis), Step Quality (per-step evaluation against coverage criteria), and Edit Analysis (gap between generated and human-edited workflows). The page is clearly marked as a dev-only tool since it is intended for workflow generator development rather than end-user operation.",
