                       "description":  "The core purpose of this tool is enabling developers to assess how accurately and completely the workflow generator produces workflows. The Edit Analysis tab reveals the gap between what the generator produces and what humans ultimately deploy by comparing generated vs edited workflow versions. The Step Quality tab evaluates individual steps against semantic coverage criteria. Together these answer: how much human intervention is needed after generation, and where does the generator fall short?",
