                       "description":  "The Pipeline Inspector\u0027s agent trace table includes schema compliance visibility for each agent in a pipeline execution. Each trace row shows whether the agent\u0027s output passed JSON schema validation on the first attempt, required coercion or retries, or failed entirely. When expanded, traces with validation failures display the specific validation error summary. This helps developers identify which agents or models consistently produce malformed output, informing model selection and prompt tuning decisions.",
